WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.836 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Over the years,
one of my favorite things

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.938
about having you on the show --
You have had many odd jobs.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:07.173
And yet every time you´re here,
I discover a new one about you.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
You worked at a carnival?
-Yes.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
As a matter of fact,
so did the guy in that clip,

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
Smokey Putnam,
the guy with the elephants.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:18.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
He didn´t work at a carnival,
but he --

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:22.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, he worked
for the circus.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we go to the carnival
to try and find him.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did that bring back
memories for you?

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh, it did.

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.330 size:81% position:41%
I worked at a carnival

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:34.300 size:84% position:42%
for a very short time
when I was quite young.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.137
I ran the Whack-The-Cats.

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:39.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
Is that like Whack-A-Mole?

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, nothing like it at all.
I mean, you´ve seen it.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.412
The cats are, like, lion faces.
-Okay.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:48.248 size:75% position:38%
-And they´re fabric.
It´s about this big.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:51.718
And, then, behind the fabric

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
is a little board
that´s about this wide.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Soft on the sides, like that.
-Got it.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you´re given
baseballs, and you throw them

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:03.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
to try and knock
the cat faces down.

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whack-The-Cats.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.866
But, of course, you miss so much
because it´s actually

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
a very thin board
behind the larger face.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I see. It tricks you into
throwing at the soft part.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.940
-Yeah, I mean, you can´t -- You
have to hit the middle of it.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:17.677
Anyway, I did the Whack-The-Cats
at this carnival.

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.946
I even roped a friend of mine

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
into working at the carnival,
as well.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:23.750
He worked the fishing well.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it´s not called
a fishing well.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is it? A wishing well
maybe or something?

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, you fish for things.
But anyway --

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was an abysmal carnival.
-Really?

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was so bleak. But, also,
I worked the day shift.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so --
I think probably the night

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the better shift
to work there maybe.

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For carnivals? Sure, yeah.
-I mean, I guess.

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s not like
you get tips, though.

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.643 size:78% position:39%
But it´s just busier,
so you pass the time.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I did teach myself
how to juggle,

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:54.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I no longer
know how to do.

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:55.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´d be great if I said
that I did that

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:57.951 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I could come out here
and juggle for you all.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:01.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I can´t. But I can´t
even bring that to the table.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:05.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
All I have
is the bathroom story.

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway --

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
And a clip.
-Yeah. You brought the clip.

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you.
-I brought the clip.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.398
Someone else sent the clip.

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. Gotcha.
You didn´t even do that.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.702 size:84% position:42%
-I didn´t even do that.

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When did you know your time
at the carnival was done?

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:20.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you ever say,
"This isn´t the life for me"?

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.609 size:75% position:38%
-[ Laughs ] Oh, yes.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:25.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to drive up there
with my buddy

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
in my little VW Bug
that had no floor.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:31.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we would go there,
and we´d --

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:34.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, I would be standing
there, and I´d be there for --

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.822
You know, there´ be a half-hour

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:38.158 size:88% position:44%
in between people coming
to the Whack-The-Cats.

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.893
It was not a very popular thing.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.128
-And then you just got close
to the cats, I´m imagining.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.497
-And the prizes stunk, sort of.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, but I was
standing there one day,

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:48.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all of a sudden,
I see the guy

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
who ran the ride
that was next to me.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.005
And the ride was one of those --
I don´t know --

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:55.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tilt-A-Whirl or Cups --
something spinning.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.410
And it was next to me there.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.712 size:84% position:42%
And I used to actually
pick him up hitchhiking

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.381 size:88% position:44%
to come to the carnival.

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So this place
obviously paid real well.

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:06.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was so --
It was so bleak.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, one day,
I was staying there --

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:11.090
So I had gotten to know the guy,

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
pick him up hitchhiking,

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:14.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all of a sudden,
he´s walking by.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.996
This is after I´ve only been
working there a few weeks.

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:18.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he´s walking by,
and he´s just got

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:21.501
this sort of demoralized look
and sort of hanging his head

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:26.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
and wandering up towards,
you know, the office,

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
which was a shed.

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.743 size:75% position:38%
And headed that way.

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:32.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"Everything all right?"

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said,
"Kid fell off the ride."

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:38.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don´t even know
if they heard that.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:40.853 size:81% position:41%
I said it too quietly.

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:43.823
-A kid fell off the ride.
-Kid fell off the ride.

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, and it just --
He said it --

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
The way he said it,
I just thought,

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.996 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I got to get
the hell out of here."

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:54.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, the way he said it
was just like, "Again."

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:57.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:58.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not shock.
-No, not --

00:03:58.972 --> 00:04:00.907 size:78% position:39%
-He´s been worn down.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:03.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was about the paperwork
or the report

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.311
or whatever the thing, you know,

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he was going to
have to fill out.

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:11.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He had to mark --
"Who fell off the ride? Kid."

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:13.786 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a really brutal job.
I didn´t last very long.

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:16.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
Only, you know,
a couple months or less.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:17.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like a month
or month and a half.

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:22.395
But I had so many, you know,
odd jobs and manual-labor jobs

00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:23.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
and ones that were
really hard --

00:04:23.863 --> 00:04:25.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, you know,
loading and unloading

00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:27.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
freight cars
and tractor-trailer trucks.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.403
I worked in a meat-packing
plant, unloading sides of beef.

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.872 size:88% position:44%
-If you had to choose --

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:36.976 size:75% position:38%
-But that job was so
calcifyingly boring.

00:04:36.976 --> 00:04:40.313
It was like retail. Retail --

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:41.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But it´s so funny
because I feel like

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.950 size:88% position:44%
people write books about
working at a carnival.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.586
No one writes -- They´re
working at the meat place.

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:48.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you´re saying
the meat job was better.

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:50.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I was busy.
-Yeah.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.759
-I was working at a carnival
that people weren´t coming to.

00:04:52.759 --> 00:04:56.429
And it was also during the day.
And no one´s there.

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:58.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
And doesn´t a carnival
live at night?

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like --

00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:02.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
It´s actually like my job,
television.

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:04.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
I got into this business

00:05:04.871 --> 00:05:06.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
´cause it was a night job.
-Yeah.

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:08.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then it turned out
that it wasn´t.

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.277
-And that was a rude awakening.

00:05:11.277 --> 00:05:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you got ripped off.
-No pun intended.

00:05:13.713 --> 00:05:15.715
-One of these days, you´re
going to find a job you like,

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:17.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I really hope that --
-No, no, no.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.584 size:75% position:38%
I do. I love my job.

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:21.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was counting on
the later hour.

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
I´m not a morning person.
-Yeah.

00:05:23.556 --> 00:05:26.359
-And -- This wouldn´t be bad.

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you show up
in the morning, don´t you?

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:30.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I do show up
in the morning, yeah.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Count me out.
-Okay.

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, please
come back again, though.

